<!--
    Themed-icon layer for Android 13+.

    A vector redraw of the artwork as a single-colour silhouette: the system
    tints this with the user's wallpaper palette, so it must carry shape only,
    no brand colour. Laid out in the 108x108 adaptive viewport with the mark
    inside the central 72x72 safe zone.
-->
